<h2>Chess Without Borders</h2>

<p>
Together with Reidar Gramstad and Thor Geir Harestad,
I co-authored the book <em>Chess Without Borders</em>,
documenting 75 years of Norwegian correspondence chess.
</p>

<p>
The book contains historical articles, player portraits
and 123 memorable correspondence games.
</p>

<p>
Published to celebrate the 75th anniversary of the Norwegian
Correspondence Chess Federation, the book documents players,
tournaments and important milestones in Norwegian
correspondence chess history.
</p>

